      "first_mes": "<welcome>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: white; position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <!-- Decorative orbs -->\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; top: -40px; right: -40px; width: 120px; height: 120px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -30px; left: -30px; width: 80px; height: 80px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\n    \n    <h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2em; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700;\">\n        ✨ Welcome to Self-evolving Character Card! ✨\n    </h1>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;\">\n            <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 5px;\">📌 Note:</strong><br>\n            If the scoped regex are activated, then this message won't be sent to AI.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #ffd700; text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); font-weight: 600;\">\n            📋 Setup Instructions:\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 35px; position: relative;\">\n                <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px; background: #ffd700; color: #764ba2; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 22px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9em;\">1</span>\n                <div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">Disable all instructions and modules of your preset except for <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,215,0,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">Char Description</strong> and <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,215,0,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">Chat History</strong></div>\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 0.9em; opacity: 0.85; padding-left: 15px;\">\n                        • If you still want to use some pre-set, re-adjust it to not conflict with the required format of responses\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 35px; position: relative;\">\n                <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px; background: #ffd700; color: #764ba2; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 22px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9em;\">2</span>\n                <div>Disable <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,100,100,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">Show &lt;tags&gt; in responses</strong> option</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 35px; position: relative;\">\n                <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px; background: #ffd700; color: #764ba2; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 22px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9em;\">3</span>\n                <div>You'd want to keep the context low, because all the LLM needs will be accumulated dynamically in the <strong style=\"background: rgba(100,255,100,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">summary</strong></div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 35px; position: relative;\">\n                <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 2px; background: #ffd700; color: #764ba2; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; text-align: center; line-height: 22px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9em;\">4</span>\n                <div>When writing your first message, try to be creative and specific - the definitions will be formed based on that message. To prevent it being generic, mention your character's <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,182,193,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">name</strong>, <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,182,193,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">age</strong>, <strong style=\"background: rgba(255,182,193,0.25); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px;\">all kinds of traits and kinks</strong>; if you want a specific setting, describe it as well.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ffed4e); padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 25px; color: #764ba2; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(255,215,0,0.3);\">\n            🌟 Good luck! 🌟\n        </span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</welcome>",
