      "creator_notes": "**Warning:** chub.ai doesn't support regex attached in card metadata.  Download and import regex separately (download button in upper right corner): https://cloud.mail.ru/public/mDLV/yUNXhbRHf\nOr, download this card directly with metadata kept: https://cloud.mail.ru/public/7TMn/T61swagGv\n\n**To use this card correctly:**\n1. Enable scoped regex\n2. Disable \"Show tags in responses\" (for correct HTML display; or just edit the card to remove HTML instruction)\n3. Don't use system prompt (turn off all modules except 'Char Description' and 'Chat History'), or adapt the current preset to not conflict with responses format.\n4. Set a maximum available Response Length.\n5. To prevent slop, make some effort for your first message (it determines the initial definitions generated by AI).\n6. To reset definitions, start a new chat (they persists for each chat, even if you will delete all messages - but you may find a fun use for that feature😊)\n7. When receiving response, you may need to wait for a while after the main content of response has been streamed (regex makes the rest to be processed \"under the hood\", updating variables as their content is fully-written).\n\nTested with Doubao Seed 1.6 in SillyTavern.\n",
